SUMMARY:The Bird-in-Hand Hot Air Balloon Festival
DESCRIPTION:See the skies come alive in Bird-In-Hand\, PA! 🎈 Get ready for an unforgettable weekend in the heart of Amish Country filled with colorful Hot Air Balloons\, great food\, music and family fun. \n\n\n\n Climb aboard and experience the thrill of rising above the festival grounds\, weather permitting & while availability lasts. Ride tickets are sold onsite only. 🚜 Free Hayrides: Climb aboard and enjoy a relaxing hayride through the beautiful Bird-in-Hand countryside — included FREE with admission🎶Music & Entertainment: Our DJ keeps the festival going with great music throughout the evening🛍️ Browse Craft & Retail Vendors for handmade goods\, unique finds and festival favorites. 🍔 Come hungry! Enjoy everything from savory favorites to sweet treats from our lineup of food vendors. 👧👦 Kids Zone: Games\, rides and plenty of fun for the little ones! Kids Zone is vendor operated. Individual activities generally range from $5–$20. 🔥 THEN AT ~8:30 PM — LOOK UP! ✨🎈 HOT AIR BALLOON GLOW & LASER SHOW!  \n\n\n\n 🧺 Bring your blankets\, lawn chairs and umbrellas\, pick your perfect spot and enjoy an incredible evening under the stars. 🎈GET READY FOR A WEEKEND YOU’LL NEVER FORGET! 🎈 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/the-bird-in-hand-hot-air-balloon-festival/
LOCATION:Bird -In -Hand PA\, 320 North Ronks Rd\, Bird-inHand\, PA\, 17505\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/4.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Hot Air Balloon and Laser Show Management":MAILTO:jeffs@balloonshow.com
END:VEVENT
