SUMMARY:Canine Partners for Life Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Canine Partners for Life (CPL)\, a non-profit organization located in Chester County\, PA\, is dedicated to increasing the independence and quality of life of individuals with physical\, developmental\, and cognitive disabilities or who are in other situations of need\, by training and placing service and companion dogs. \n\n\n\n Fall Festival featuring Cow Bingo is a free\, family-friendly event that brings the community together to celebrate this mission. The event features mission-centered booths and activities\, puppy kissing booth\, campus tours and service dog demonstrations\, local vendors\, live music\, games\, food trucks\, and of course\, Cow Bingo. This year\, Fall Festival will be larger than ever\, with the addition of a pie contest\, an expanded basket raffle\, featuring gift cards of up to $100 in value\, more opportunities for hands-on interaction with service dogs in training\, puppies\, and ambassador dogs\, and an enhanced sensory room. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/canine-partners-for-life-fall-festival/
LOCATION:Canine Partners for Life\, 334 Faggs Manor Rd\, Cochranville\, PA\, 19330\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ORGANIZER;CN="Canine Partners for Life":MAILTO:dblenke@k94life.org
END:VEVENT
