SUMMARY:Train Room Open House
DESCRIPTION:The Garden Spot Village Train Room Open House will delight visitors of all ages. The HO-gauge train layout includes Thomasville and the ever-popular “Talk with Thomas” event. The O-gauge layout includes an elevated track. Both layouts provide plenty of train action complemented with heavily detailed scenery. Free and open to the public. Donations welcome. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
