SUMMARY:Macramé Plant Pod Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Create your own hanging plant pod during this beginner-friendly macramé workshop! Learn four essential styles of knots: the Lark’s Head Knot\, the Square Knot\, the Alternating Square Knot\, and the Gathering Knot. In just over an hour\, you will complete a small hanging pod perfect for plants\, propagation\, and more. Relax\, have fun\, and take home a one-of-a-kind macrame masterpiece.  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/macrame-plant-pod-workshop/
LOCATION:Ware Center for the Arts\, 42 N. Prince St.\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
