SUMMARY:"Rooted" Dance Performance by Luna Dance Company
DESCRIPTION:Join LUNA Dance Company for Rooted\, an evening of original contemporary dance exploring identity\, influence\, and the foundations that shape who we become. Featuring the world premiere of ‘Levels of Verticality’ by award-winning guest choreographer Noelle Kayser\, alongside new works by Artistic Director Emmanuel Williams\, Rooted celebrates the artistry\, athleticism\, and creative spirit of professional contemporary dance in Lancaster. \n\n\n\nShowtimes are 2:30 PM and 7:00 PM. Tickets are pay-what-you-will donations.  \n\n\n\n\n    get tickets
