SUMMARY:Rooted & Restored Yoga
DESCRIPTION:Start your Sunday surrounded by nature at Gallery Grow. Join E-RYT 200 yoga teacher Maggie Mowery for a beginner-friendly\, all-levels yoga class in our courtyard (weather permitting)\, featuring gentle movement\, breathwork\, and a guided meditation inspired by the connection between plants and personal wellness.  \n\n\n\nAfter class\, enjoy an exclusive 20% off your Gallery Grow purchase before 12 PM. Please note: Yoga will be held outdoors in the courtyard\, weather permitting. In the event of rain\, the class will be moved upstairs to our Loft area\, which is accessible by stairs only. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
