SUMMARY:Wellness Fair at Greenfield
DESCRIPTION:Prioritize your well-being and discover valuable resources to support a healthier lifestyle at Greenfield’s Wellness Fair. Enjoy an afternoon dedicated to health\, wellness\, and community connection as local wellness-focused businesses and organizations share information\, services\, educational resources\, and demonstrations. This event is hosted in partnership with The High Companies’ Wellness Committee and will feature a variety of wellness-focused vendors and organizations\, many of which are proud Greenfield tenants! \n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
