SUMMARY:Weaver Awards Celebration 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate the 2026 Weaver Award recipients\, the people weaving the social fabric of Lancaster County. \n\n\n\nThe Weaver Awards recognize individuals and small organizations whose ideas\, creativity\, generosity\, and commitment are helping strengthen our neighborhoods and build a more connected community. Join us at The Country Barn for an evening celebrating this year’s Weaver Award winners\, a seasonal farm to table supper\, live local music and dance\, and what makes Lancaster County special. \n\n\n\nThis event is free and open to the public\, but registration is required. Dress to impress or wear what makes you feel most comfortable. Please come as you are. \n\n\n\nPlease Note: This event will be photographed and filmed. By entering the venue\, you acknowledge that you may be photographed or recorded and that these images and recordings may be used by the Lancaster County Community Foundation for internal and external purposes\, including promotional and social media materials. Thank you for your understanding! \n\n\n\n\n    Reserve a spot
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/weaver-awards-celebration-2026/
LOCATION:The Country Barn\, 211 S. Donerville Road\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/Weaver-Awards-Social-Media-Graphic-scaled.avif
END:VEVENT
