SUMMARY:Ghost Tour of Lancaster
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Halloween with bone-chilling tales of haunted mansions\, eerie cemeteries and spirits that roam the night! Join us for a Candlelight Ghost Tour of downtown Lancaster\, and discover the ghosts and mysteries that haunt us to this day. Based on the book\, Ghost Stories of Lancaster. Tours run every Wednesday through Sunday through Halloween weekend. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Learn More
