SUMMARY:Trinity First Friday Speaker Series
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Trinity Lutheran Church\, 31 S. Duke Street for a Trinity First Friday Speaker Series event. The speaker will be Stephanie Celiberti\, Manager of James Buchanan’s Wheatland\, presenting President Buchanan as a Gentleman Farmer. The evening will begin at 5PM with the playing of the Church bells and a short organ demonstration. The main speaker presentation will start at 5:30PM followed by sanctuary tours and refreshments. All activities will be held in the Church Sanctuary at the corner of Duke and Mifflin Streets. Free parking is provided. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/trinity-first-friday-speaker-series-5/
