SUMMARY:Peace Kids to the Rescue Art Show and Silent Auction
DESCRIPTION:Join Peace Kids to the Rescue at The Ware Center for the Arts (42 N. Prince Street) for their 8th Art Show and silent auction. Over 70 children have donated art to this year’s show with proceeds benefiting CWS and Arch Street Center\, Inc. There will be a collaborative canvas for the community to help create\, free food and drinks\, and Peace Kids merchandise for sale.  \n\n\n\nThis year\, Splits & Giggles Cafe will also be selling ice cream\, Nick DiSanto/One Man Band will be playing music (7-8 pm) and Jenny Hill will be offering free essence portraits. Don’t miss the inspiration\, connection and fun! \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/peace-kids-to-the-rescue-art-show-and-silent-auction/
LOCATION:Ware Center for the Arts\, 42 N. Prince St.\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/a14c2c01-7420-44da-8a9d-4bbc3731a6e4.avif
END:VEVENT
