SUMMARY:Drink More Art: Live Painting with Sarah Hawkins at Vine Bar
DESCRIPTION:Vine Bar presents “Drink More Art\,” a special First Friday collaboration featuring a live painting session by Lancaster abstract expressionist artist Sarah Hawkins.\n\nFrom 6–8 PM\, guests can experience Hawkins’ instinctive creative process as a new original work takes shape. The evening pairs live art with Vine Bar’s welcoming enoteca atmosphere\, natural and artisanal Italian wines\, and a selection of original artwork available to shop.\n\nThe event will take place in the alleyway beside Endo Café\, with Vine Bar’s interior enoteca serving as the alternate location in the event of inclement weather. Open to the public and held rain or shine. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/drink-more-art-live-painting-with-sarah-hawkins-at-vine-bar/
LOCATION:Vine Bar\, 237 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/Vine-Bar-x-Sarah-Hawkins-_-Drink-More-Art-IG-Feed.avif
